        "end_character": 3877
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001818874-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001818874-26-000013-f8f945048d88b1f6",
        "accession_number": "0001818874-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we provide introductory brokerage services to our members and have invested heavily to create an appealing mobile investing experience.",
        "start_character": 25732,
        "end_character": 25881
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001818874-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001818874-26-000013-f8f945048d88b1f6",
        "accession_number": "0001818874-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we sell certain of the loans we originate to third parties and are therefore subject to laws governing parties that service loans on behalf of another person to whom the debt is owed.",
        "start_character": 84249,
        "end_character": 84446
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001818874-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001818874-26-000013-f8f945048d88b1f6",
        "accession_number": "0001818874-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order to deliver on our strategy, we must develop a comprehensive set of best-in-class products that build trust and reliability with our members and our platform.",
        "start_character": 10948,
        "end_character": 11114
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001818874-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001818874-26-000013-f8f945048d88b1f6",
        "accession_number": "0001818874-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Moreover, through SoFi Securities, we are licensed to underwrite securities offerings and have served as a firm commitment underwriter of, or as selling agent on, registered equity securities offerings.",
        "start_character": 95897,
        "end_character": 96099
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001818874-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001818874-26-000013-f8f945048d88b1f6",
        "accession_number": "0001818874-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To complement these products and services, we believe in building vertically-integrated technology platforms designed to manage and deliver the suite of solutions to our members in a low-cost and differentiated manner.",
        "start_character": 9792,
        "end_character": 10010
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001818874-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001818874-26-000013-f8f945048d88b1f6",
        "accession_number": "0001818874-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer financial services solutions which are designed to appeal to enterprises, including our At Work product and lending related services offered through our Loan Platform Business.",
        "start_character": 22905,
        "end_character": 23095
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001818874-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001818874-26-000013-f8f945048d88b1f6",
        "accession_number": "0001818874-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also originate and sell loans in support of our Loan Platform Business, through which we provide lending related services to third-party partners.",
        "start_character": 17272,
        "end_character": 17421
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001818874-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001818874-26-000013-f8f945048d88b1f6",
        "accession_number": "0001818874-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are subject to federal and state laws designed to protect consumers and prohibit unfair or deceptive business practices.",
        "start_character": 67042,
        "end_character": 67165
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001818874-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001818874-26-000013-f8f945048d88b1f6",
        "accession_number": "0001818874-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe supporting, developing and inspiring our employees will ultimately unlock the potential of the organization, drive excellence across the business and solidify SoFi as a top career destination where people love to work.",
        "start_character": 113353,
        "end_character": 113582
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001818874-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001818874-26-000013-f8f945048d88b1f6",
        "accession_number": "0001818874-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that developing a comprehensive, long-term relationship with our members and gaining their trust is central to our success as a financial services platform.",
        "start_character": 10052,
        "end_character": 10219
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001818874-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001818874-26-000013-f8f945048d88b1f6",
        "accession_number": "0001818874-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete at multiple levels, including: (i) competition among other personal loan, student loan, credit card and residential lenders, (ii) competition for deposits among other banks, some challenger banks and a variety of technology and retail companies, (iii) competition with social media and other commerce platforms and applications that offer peer-to-peer, in-app and social commerce payment capabilities, (iv) competition for investment accounts among other introductory brokerage firms and a variety of technology and other companies, (v) competition with other digital asset trading platforms and banks that offer digital asset trading and other services and products, (vi) competition for subscribers to financial services content, and (vii) competition among other technology platforms for the enterprise services we provide, such as platform as a service and cloud-native digital and core banking services.",
